  "petit-dejeuner-prestige-entreprise-paris": {
    "titre": "A prestige corporate breakfast: how to get it right and what budget?",
    "metaTitle": "Luxury corporate breakfast: budget and tips",
    "extrait": "Porcelain, table linen, flowers, a maître d'hôtel: what turns an office breakfast into a reception, and the real budget for 30 people in Paris.",
    "enBref": [
      "A prestige breakfast is the same buffet as a full breakfast, served on porcelain, on a tablecloth, with flowers and a maître d'hôtel.",
      "At L'Écrin Traiteur, the Classique breakfast costs €8 per person excl. VAT; 30 people come to €269 excl. VAT, delivery included.",
      "The maître d'hôtel costs €250 excl. VAT for a 6-hour service; porcelain and tablecloths come from Options, flowers from a partner florist, on quote.",
      "Order until 10 am the day before, 48 hours ahead from 50 people."
    ],
    "contenu": "\n      <p>A <strong>prestige breakfast</strong> for a board meeting, a client reception or a morning in a reception room does not call for different products from a good office breakfast. What changes is the staging: <strong>porcelain instead of disposables, a white tablecloth, flowers, a maître d'hôtel</strong>. The photo in this article shows a breakfast served by L'Écrin Traiteur in the salon of a Parisian hôtel particulier (private mansion).</p>\n\n      <h2>What makes a prestige breakfast</h2>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Element</th><th>Classic breakfast</th><th>Prestige breakfast</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>Tableware</strong></td><td>Cups and napkins provided</td><td>Porcelain cups and saucers, glasses</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Table</strong></td><td>Meeting table</td><td>White tablecloth, wooden boards</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Decoration</strong></td><td>None</td><td>Low flower arrangements on the buffet</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Service</strong></td><td>Delivery, everyone helps themselves</td><td>A maître d'hôtel who welcomes guests, serves coffee and restocks</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Products</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\">The same: butter pastries, madeleines, fruit skewers, Alain Milliat juices in glass bottles, coffee and tea in thermos flasks</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <h2>What budget for 30 people?</h2>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Item</th><th>Amount excl. VAT</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>Classique breakfast</strong> (pastries, juice, coffee, fruit), 30 × €8</td><td>€240</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Delivery with collection of the tableware</strong>, Paris, 92 and 94</td><td>€39</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Maître d'hôtel</strong>, 6-hour service</td><td>€250</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Full breakfast</strong> (60 mini pastries, madeleines and cake, 30 skewers, coffee, tea, juice), instead of the Classique</td><td>on quote</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Porcelain and table linen</strong></td><td>on quote; tableware hire is observed at €2.50 to €4 per guest in the mid-range</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Flowers</strong></td><td>on quote; a low centrepiece generally costs €25 to €90</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <p>For 30 people, the L'Écrin base (Classique breakfast, delivery with collection and maître d'hôtel) comes to <strong>€529 excl. VAT</strong>; the full breakfast is quoted on request. With porcelain, a tablecloth and three flower arrangements, count a few hundred euros more depending on your choices.</p>\n\n      <h2>How many maîtres d'hôtel?</h2>\n      <p>For a breakfast served on real tableware, caterers count about 1 member of service staff for 50 guests. One maître d'hôtel is therefore enough for up to around fifty people. The detail by format is in our guide <a href=\"/journal/combien-maitres-hotel-evenement-entreprise\">how many maîtres d'hôtel for an event</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>The details that show</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Drinks in glass bottles</strong>: Alain Milliat juices set on the table are part of the decoration.</li>\n        <li><strong>Wooden boards</strong> rather than boxes: pastries are laid out flat, row by row.</li>\n        <li><strong>Low flowers</strong>: under 30 cm, so as not to hide the buffet or people's faces.</li>\n        <li><strong>Enough cups</strong>: one per person, plus a 10% margin.</li>\n        <li><strong>Set up before arrival</strong>: the buffet should be ready at least 15 minutes before the first guests.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2>With L'Écrin Traiteur</h2>\n      <p>We deliver from 6:30 am in Paris and Île-de-France. Our maîtres d'hôtel are selected and trained by our house; porcelain and table linen come from Options, flowers from a partner florist, on the same quote. See our <a href=\"/creations/petits-dejeuners-et-pauses\">breakfasts</a>, our <a href=\"/tarifs\">prices</a>, or <a href=\"/devis\">request a quote</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>Sources</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>L'Écrin Traiteur prices: <a href=\"/tarifs\">2026 prices</a>, as of 17 October 2026.</li>\n        <li>Staffing for a breakfast on real tableware: Firmin Traiteur (1 June 2022).</li>\n        <li>Tableware hire: Au bonheur des convives (2 April 2026). Centrepieces: <a href=\"https://www.marie-paolini.com/decoration-florale-evenementiel/\" rel=\"noopener\">Marie Paolini, florist</a>, accessed 17 October 2026.</li>\n      </ul>\n    ",
    "faq": [
      {
        "q": "How much does a prestige breakfast for 30 people cost?",
        "a": "At L'Écrin Traiteur, €529 excl. VAT for the Classique breakfast, delivery with collection of the tableware and a maître d'hôtel for 6 hours, plus porcelain, table linen and flowers, on quote. The full breakfast is quoted on request."
      },
      {
        "q": "Do you need a maître d'hôtel for a breakfast?",
        "a": "For a breakfast served on porcelain, yes: a maître d'hôtel welcomes guests, serves coffee and restocks. One is enough for up to around fifty people."
      }
    ]
  },
